{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-192634-r4615177","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Buttermilk Curry Soup (Kadi Pakora)","sourcePageId":192634,"sourceRevision":"4615177","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2026-02-03T02:32:46Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Buttermilk%20Curry%20Soup%20(Kadi%20Pakora)&oldid=4615177","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:35:08.141Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Indian recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for curry","Category:Recipes for soup","Category:Recipes using asafoetida","Category:Recipes using buttermilk","Category:Recipes using chickpea flour","Category:Recipes using curry leaf","Category:Recipes using fresh ginger","Category:Recipes using garlic","Category:Recipes using mustard seed","Category:Recipes using vegetable oil"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"226ffef69e3bded9d4c199f999f240a7cffabcecb4306ef09697a7b834d21f62","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__{{recipesummary|category=Soup recipes|servings=4|time=35 minutes\n}}{{recipe}}\n==Ingredients==\n\n=== Pakora ===\n*1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Chickpea Flour|besan]] (chickpea flour)\n*Water\n*Salt\n*[[Cookbook:Turmeric|Turmeric]] powder\n*Vegetable oil\n\n=== Curry ===\n*2 glasses cultured [[Cookbook:Buttermilk|buttermilk]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] besan\n*Turmeric powder\n*1 [[Cookbook:Pinch|pinch]] of [[Cookbook:Asafoetida|asafoetida]]\n*Salt\n*Black [[Cookbook:Mustard seed|mustard seeds]]\n*1 clove [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]], [[Cookbook:Mincing|minced]]\n*¼-[[Cookbook:Inch|inch]] piece of [[Cookbook:Ginger|ginger]] root, peeled and minced\n*4–5 kadi patta ([[Cookbook:Curry Leaf|curry leaves]])\n*1 small [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]], finely [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]]\n \n==Procedure==\n\n=== Pakora ===\n#Mix besan with water, salt, and turmeric powder until you get a thick [[Cookbook:Batter|batter]].\n#Heat oil in big pan.\n#Drop dollops of batter in the pan using a round spoon so that pakoras are round and fluffy.\n#[[Cookbook:Frying|Fry]] until the pakoras are golden, then remove them from the oil.\n\n=== Curry ===\n#Mix buttermilk, 1 tbsp besan, turmeric powder, asafoetida, and salt until smooth and lump-free.\n#Heat a little oil in a pan. Add mustard seeds, garlic, ginger, curry leaves, and onion, then fry it until slightly reddish in color.\n#Stir the buttermilk mixture, and mix it into the onions. Continue mixing it over medium heat until it starts bubbling.\n#Add the pakoras, lower the heat, and keep for some time. Close the lid and switch off the flame.\n#Serve hot with rice or roti.\n \n==Notes, tips, and variations==\n\n* If you want to make it more spicy, put [[Cookbook:Garam Masala|garam masala]] and [[Cookbook:Chili Powder|chilli powder]] in both the pakora and the curry.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for soup]]\n[[Category:Recipes for curry]]\n[[Category:Indian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using asafoetida]]\n[[Category:Recipes using buttermilk]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chickpea flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using curry leaf]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]\n[[Category:Recipes using fresh ginger]]\n[[Category:Recipes using vegetable oil]]\n[[Category:Recipes using mustard seed]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Buttermilk Curry Soup (Kadi Pakora)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 cup besan (chickpea flour)","sourceText":"1 cup besan (chickpea flour)","amountText":"1 cup besan (chickpea flour)","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"Water","sourceText":"Water","amountText":"Water","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"Salt","sourceText":"Salt","amountText":"Salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"Turmeric powder","sourceText":"Turmeric powder","amountText":"Turmeric powder","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"Vegetable oil","sourceText":"Vegetable oil","amountText":"Vegetable oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"2 glasses cultured buttermilk","sourceText":"2 glasses cultured buttermilk","amountText":"2 glasses cultured buttermilk","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"1 tbsp besan","sourceText":"1 tbsp besan","amountText":"1 tbsp besan","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"Turmeric powder","sourceText":"Turmeric powder","amountText":"Turmeric powder","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"1 pinch of asafoetida","sourceText":"1 pinch of asafoetida","amountText":"1 pinch of asafoetida","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-10","name":"Salt","sourceText":"Salt","amountText":"Salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-11","name":"Black mustard seeds","sourceText":"Black mustard seeds","amountText":"Black mustard seeds","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-12","name":"1 clove garlic, minced","sourceText":"1 clove garlic, minced","amountText":"1 clove garlic, minced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-13",